#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking/dominance.md:7
msgid "Dominator"
msgstr "支配判定器"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking/dominance.md:9
msgid ""
"Comparators in the [ParetoComparator](comparators.md) family "
"(`NSGA2Comparator`/`HypervolumeComparator`/`NSGA3Comparator`/`RNSGA2Comparator`/`EpsilonDominanceComparator`)"
" delegate the definition of the dominance relation itself to `Dominator`,"
" a swappable component. When you want to use a preference relation other "
"than Pareto dominance, you only need to swap out the `dominator` "
"argument, not the Comparator itself."
msgstr ""
"[ParetoComparator](comparators.md)系のComparator（`NSGA2Comparator`/`HypervolumeComparator`/`NSGA3Comparator`/`RNSGA2Comparator`/`EpsilonDominanceComparator`）は、支配関係の定義そのものを`Dominator`という差し替え可能なコンポーネントに委ねています。"
" Pareto支配以外の選好関係を使いたいときは、これらのComparator本体ではなく`dominator`引数だけを差し替えればよいです。"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking/dominance.md:12
msgid "Dominator's role"
msgstr "Dominatorの役割"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking/dominance.md:14
msgid ""
"`Dominator` requires only one method, `dominance_matrix(f, "
"direction=None)`, to be implemented. `f` is a matrix of objective values "
"with shape `(n, n_obj)`; it returns a boolean matrix of shape `(n, n)` "
"where `D[i, j]` indicates \"does row `i` dominate row `j`.\" `f` is "
"assumed to contain no NaN; the caller is responsible for guaranteeing "
"this."
msgstr ""
"`Dominator`が実装を要求するメソッドは`dominance_matrix(f, direction=None)`の1つだけです。 "
"`f`はshape `(n, n_obj)`の目的関数値の行列で、`D[i, j]`が「行`i`が行`j`を支配するか」を示すshape `(n,"
" n)`のブール行列を返します。 `f`はNaNを含まない前提であり、呼び出し側がその保証を担います。"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking/dominance.md:18
msgid ""
"There's also `dominates(fa, fb, direction=None) -> bool`, which compares "
"just two points, but this is a default implementation derived from "
"`dominance_matrix` — when implementing a custom `Dominator`, implementing"
" `dominance_matrix` alone automatically guarantees consistency with "
"`dominates`. Internally, it stacks `fa`/`fb` into two rows and calls "
"`dominance_matrix`. If `fa` contains NaN, it always returns `False` (does"
" not dominate), while NaN on the `fb` side is replaced with `+inf` and "
"treated as an individual that \"is always dominated\" — an asymmetric "
"treatment."
msgstr ""
"2点だけを比較する`dominates(fa, fb, direction=None) -> "
"bool`も持ちますが、これは`dominance_matrix`から導出される既定実装であり、独自に`Dominator`を実装する際は`dominance_matrix`さえ実装すれば`dominates`との整合性が自動的に保証されます。"
" 内部では`fa`/`fb`を2行のスタックにして`dominance_matrix`を呼びます。 "
"`fa`にNaNが含まれる場合は常に`False`（支配しない）を返す一方、`fb`側のNaNは`+inf`に置き換えられ「常に支配される」個体として扱われる、という非対称な扱いになっています。"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking/dominance.md:22
msgid "Built-in Dominators"
msgstr "組み込みDominator"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking/dominance.md
msgid "Class"
msgstr "クラス"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking/dominance.md
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking/dominance.md
msgid "Characteristics"
msgstr "特徴"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking/dominance.md
msgid "`ParetoDominator`"
msgstr "`ParetoDominator`"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking/dominance.md
msgid "None"
msgstr "なし"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking/dominance.md
msgid ""
"Standard Pareto dominance. Considered dominance when at or below on every"
" objective, and strictly less on at least one objective (default)"
msgstr "標準Pareto支配。全目的で以下、かつ少なくとも1目的で真に小さい場合に支配とみなす（既定）"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking/dominance.md
msgid "`EpsilonDominator`"
msgstr "`EpsilonDominator`"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking/dominance.md
msgid "`eps, mode=\"additive\"`"
msgstr "`eps, mode=\"additive\"`"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking/dominance.md
msgid "Quantizes into ε-boxes and then delegates internally to `ParetoDominator`"
msgstr "ε-boxに量子化してから内部で`ParetoDominator`に委譲する"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking/dominance.md:29
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`EpsilonDominator` implements the ε-dominance of "
"{cite}`laumanns2002epsilon`. There are two quantization modes."
msgstr ""
"`EpsilonDominator`は、{cite}`laumanns2002epsilon`のε-支配を実装したものです。 "
"量子化モードは2種類あります。"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking/dominance.md:32
msgid ""
"**additive** (default): Computes each objective's box index as `floor(f_i"
" / eps_i)`"
msgstr "**additive**（既定）：各目的の箱番号を`floor(f_i / eps_i)`で計算する"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking/dominance.md:33
msgid ""
"**multiplicative**: Computes it as `floor(log(f_i) / log(1 + eps_i))`. "
"Assumes all objective values are positive; raises `ValueError` otherwise"
msgstr ""
"**multiplicative**：`floor(log(f_i) / log(1 + "
"eps_i))`で計算する。目的関数値が全て正であることが前提で、そうでない場合は`ValueError`になる"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking/dominance.md:35
msgid ""
"`eps` is specified as a scalar or an array of shape `(n_obj,)`, and every"
" element must be positive (otherwise `ValueError` at construction time)."
msgstr ""
"`eps`はスカラーまたはshape "
"`(n_obj,)`の配列で指定し、全要素が正でなければなりません（そうでない場合は構築時に`ValueError`）。"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking/dominance.md:37
msgid ""
"[EpsilonDominanceComparator](comparators.md) is a thin wrapper that "
"simply passes `EpsilonDominator(eps, mode)` to `ParetoComparator`'s "
"`dominator` argument."
msgstr ""
"[EpsilonDominanceComparator](comparators.md)は、`ParetoComparator`の`dominator`引数に`EpsilonDominator(eps,"
" mode)`を渡すだけの薄いラッパーです。"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking/dominance.md:40
msgid ""
"For new code, use "
"`ParetoDominator().dominates(...)`/`ParetoDominator().dominance_matrix(...)`"
" directly."
msgstr "新しいコードでは、`ParetoDominator().dominates(...)`または`ParetoDominator().dominance_matrix(...)`を直接使ってください。"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking/dominance.md:43
msgid "Implementing a custom Dominator"
msgstr "独自Dominatorの実装方法"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking/dominance.md:45
msgid ""
"If you need a custom dominance relation, subclass `Dominator` and "
"implement only `dominance_matrix()`. The following example applies a "
"scaling factor to each objective before applying Pareto dominance."
msgstr ""
"独自の支配関係が必要な場合は、`Dominator`を継承して`dominance_matrix()`だけを実装すればよいです。 "
"次の例は、各目的にスケーリング係数をかけてからPareto支配を適用します。"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking/dominance.md:64
msgid ""
"As with `EpsilonDominator`, delegating to the existing `ParetoDominator` "
"on the converted values means you don't have to write the objective-value"
" comparison logic yourself."
msgstr "`EpsilonDominator`と同様に、既存の`ParetoDominator`へ変換後の値を委譲する実装にすると、直接目的関数値を比較するロジックを自分で書かずに済みます。"

